# workspace/ 是 bind mount 的執行期狀態，只帶 git 追蹤的骨架檔（issue 0025）。
# 新增追蹤檔時這裡也要放行，tests/docker/dockerignore-workspace.test.ts 會比對。
workspace/**
!workspace/.gitignore
!workspace/.opencode/opencode.json
!workspace/.opencode/skills/.gitkeep
!workspace/projects/.gitkeep
